WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:05,280
We can just choose whatever we want. Thank you, the lady.

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,440
Your boyfriend is so nice

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,120
A man is willing to accompany you

4
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,280
Let’s buy sanitary napkins together

5
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:11,880
That means this man really loves you, right?

6
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:13,680
Can you really tell he loves me?

7
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:19,430
Why do I feel like he doesn't love me at all? Chen Yundong, tell me honestly, do you love me? Stop making trouble.

8
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,020
I'll wait for you in the car outside

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:43,850
You are so cowardly

10
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:45,090
Let you accompany me to buy a pack of sanitary cooking

11
00:00:45,090 --> 00:00:56,260
You can run faster than the cook. What socks did I buy you?

12
00:00:56,260 --> 00:01:03,680
The day before yesterday when I went out to see you putting on shoes, the socks on your feet had holes in them and you were still wearing them. Thank you.

13
00:01:04,890 --> 00:01:06,010
Just a pair of socks

14
00:01:06,010 --> 00:01:09,940
As for saying thank you? Socks are also a sign of affection in my childhood.

15
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:12,140
Then according to what you said

16
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:15,180
You can't thank me by treating me to a meal

17
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:16,980
I'll treat you to dinner next time I have a chance

18
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:18,660
But I can't afford it if it's too expensive

19
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:22,470
Then I really take it seriously.

20
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:42,700
At nine o'clock, drive the car downstairs and wait for me.

21
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:44,740
French customers are coming today

22
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:46,660
Our company has been talking to this customer for two years.

23
00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:48,780
The other party came over to sign a contract with us today

24
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:49,820
So for our company

25
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:51,180
Today is very, very important

26
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,780
So you must pay attention to

27
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,820
You can't make any mistakes, you know?
